{
  "_comment": [
    "Official PICO 4 (A8110, codename phoenix) full OTA packages on PICO's CDN.",
    "Pick the build that matches the headset: adb shell getprop ro.build.fingerprint,",
    "ro.pvr.internal.version (build number _bNNNN_) and ro.oem.state",
    "(true = SEKO/OEM build, empty = SEK/non-OEM build). The same OTA serves",
    "PICO 4, PICO 4 Pro and PICO 4 Enterprise.",
    "Each build's mirrors are the same archive on PICO's other hosts (same name and size); a download takes",
    "the fastest (ota.fastest). Its rescue pins the size and SHA-256 of each member the rescue reads",
    "(python -m overpressure rescue pin), so whichever host serves it, the same bytes go on the headset."
  ],
